# Captain bookkeeping exclusions; these files remain Git-tracked.
# One Git ignore pattern per line. Blank lines, # comments and ! exclusions work.
# This file and policy files themselves always use ordinary versioned commits.
/.captain-sdlc/notebook/notes.json
/.captain-sdlc/notebook/history.jsonl
/.captain-sdlc/notebook/dashboard.md
/.captain-sdlc/handoffs/*.md
/.captain-sdlc/closeouts/*.md
/Churn/*.md
